MUSIC AND SOUND EFFECTS
  Original. Every note and every effect are synthesized in mix.py,
  _shared/audio/band.py (including the 0.8 s channel sting, band.sting), the scene-by-scene groove layer _shared/audio/groove.py
  and the cartoon effects of _shared/audio/toon.py (numpy/scipy), with the procedural helpers of core/audio/sfx.py.
  The score (MUSIC.md, "Glow-Code Bossa") uses the synthesized flute, glockenspiel, harp, marimba, celesta, xylophone,
  pizzicato, upright bass and toy horn voices of band.py; Chirp's cricket is band.chirp.
  No samples, loops or recordings by third parties.

